  "description": "Bring out the deep, glassy look that dark paint is supposed to have with Black Light Hybrid Radiant Finish Car Wash Soap, a foaming car shampoo built for black, dark gray, dark blue, midnight purple, and other deep-tone finishes on clear coat. Black Light is the wash soap dark-paint owners reach for when they want every wash day to feel like a fresh coat of wax. The hybrid formula blends a pH-balanced wash soap with optical brighteners and gloss-enhancing polymers, helping darker paint look deeper, wetter, and more dimensional. The result is a finish that does not just look clean; it looks lit up under the sun, garage lights, and street lights alike. Black Light is gentle on existing waxes, sealants, and ceramic coatings, so you can wash often without stripping the paint layer built in the last full detail. This foam cannon soap works beautifully in cannons and traditional two-bucket setups for vehicle cleaning. Pre-foam the vehicle, let the suds dwell, grab a clean microfiber wash mitt, and work top down through your wash bucket. Follow with the Woolly Mammoth Drying Towel, JetSeal Sealant, and Black Light Hybrid Spray Sealant for weekly show car maintenance and finish enhancement.",
